WEBVTT

00:02.410 --> 00:07.920
<u>I  LOVE  ANIME</u>

00:02.410 --> 00:07.920
STUDIO  RIVA - Nyo

00:02.410 --> 00:07.920
<b>#ILA @ Rizon</b>

00:06.220 --> 00:12.920
<b>Sekai de ichiban kagayakeru made</b>

00:13.500 --> 00:19.260
<b>Ichinichi mainichi wo tanoshiku ikite</b>

00:19.500 --> 00:24.770
<b>Totsuzen umarekuru setsuna no fuan</b>

00:25.280 --> 00:31.370
<b>2000-nen mondai yori
jibun no yume</b>

00:31.480 --> 00:37.350
<b>Sekai de ichiban kagayakitai</b>

00:37.450 --> 00:40.420
<b>Omoi wa number 1 star</b>

00:40.520 --> 00:43.490
<b>Kono sora no naka de</b>

00:48.580 --> 00:50.070
<b>Nyuuu!</b>

00:50.350 --> 00:52.980
<b>Nyu! Nyu! Nyu! Nyu!</b>

00:53.690 --> 00:54.480
<b>Nyu!</b>

00:55.320 --> 00:56.480
<b>Nyuu!</b>

00:57.090 --> 00:58.490
<b>Nyu!</b>

00:59.230 --> 01:00.950
<b>Nyuuu!</b>

01:05.200 --> 01:07.000
<b>Puchiko-chan,
what are you doing?</b>

01:07.100 --> 01:08.430
<b>Nyu.</b>

01:08.530 --> 01:09.970
<b>I know, I know.</b>

01:10.070 --> 01:11.730
<b>You're practicing
the Laser Eye Beam.</b>

01:11.840 --> 01:14.240
<b>Nyuu!</b>

01:14.340 --> 01:17.040
<b>That's not the right way.</b>

01:17.140 --> 01:18.340
<b>Nyu?</b>

01:18.440 --> 01:19.500
<b>You see...</b>

01:20.850 --> 01:25.410
<b>You need to have your anger index
towards somebody rise.</b>

01:25.520 --> 01:30.510
<b>That and fierce emotion etc.
happen to produce the beam.</b>

01:30.820 --> 01:35.590
<b>So it might be a little hard
for you, Puchiko-chan.</b>

01:39.130 --> 01:41.030
<b>Nyo nyo nyoo!</b>

01:42.640 --> 01:43.600
<b>Gema gema!</b>

01:43.700 --> 01:45.140
<b>Don't say ''gema gema'' nyo!</b>

01:45.240 --> 01:46.640
<b>Don't say ''nyo nyo'' gema!</b>

01:46.740 --> 01:47.640
<b>Nyooooo!</b>

01:47.740 --> 01:48.670
<b>Gemaaaaaa!</b>

01:48.780 --> 01:50.240
<b>Nyo nyo!</b>

01:50.340 --> 01:52.810
<b>Laser Eye Beam!!</b>

01:53.010 --> 01:55.310
<b>Gema!!!</b>

01:59.650 --> 02:02.280
<b>Dejiko is not one to lose
to a measly little Gema nyo.</b>

02:02.390 --> 02:03.250
<b>Gema!</b>

02:03.360 --> 02:05.450
<b>I'll take you anytime nyo!</b>

02:05.560 --> 02:07.490
<b>I'm so sad gema!</b>

02:07.590 --> 02:11.120
<b>Her anger index
is always so high nyu.</b>

02:13.100 --> 02:14.760
<b>Nyo.</b>

02:17.400 --> 02:21.430
<b>First I need to start practice
getting angry nyu.</b>

02:25.450 --> 02:27.410
<b>Nyu nyu. Heavy nyu.</b>

02:27.510 --> 02:29.610
<b>Go away nyu!</b>

02:33.550 --> 02:35.820
<b>It should be safe here nyu.</b>

02:36.660 --> 02:39.320
<b>Now to sleep in peace nyu.</b>

02:42.700 --> 02:45.190
<b>They are scum nyo.</b>

02:59.950 --> 03:02.350
<b>What a great toguro nyo.</b>

03:03.550 --> 03:06.810
<b>I was able to Laser Eye Beam nyu.</b>

03:08.920 --> 03:10.050
<b>Nyo nyo!</b>

03:10.160 --> 03:10.780
<b>Gema gema!</b>

03:10.890 --> 03:11.360
<b>Nyo!</b>

03:11.460 --> 03:11.890
<b>Gema!</b>

03:12.530 --> 03:15.460
<b>How dare you Laser Eye Beam me
in the middle of the night gema!</b>

03:15.560 --> 03:18.330
<b>You also crushed me with the
kotatsu and TV and other stuff nyo!</b>

03:18.430 --> 03:21.530
<b>I was dreaming that I was eating
cotton candy in a flower field too!</b>

03:21.630 --> 03:22.600
<b>Gema gema!</b>

03:23.400 --> 03:24.560
<b>Nyuu! Nyuu!</b>

03:25.340 --> 03:27.600
<b>Nyu! Nyuu! Nyuu!</b>

03:28.440 --> 03:29.570
<b>You know, Puchiko-chan...</b>

03:30.240 --> 03:32.800
<b>Even if you can't do the
Laser Eye Beam right now...</b>

03:32.910 --> 03:35.810
<b>as you grow older
and experience many things,</b>

03:35.920 --> 03:37.210
<b>you will soon be able to.</b>

03:40.750 --> 03:42.880
<b>Or maybe you won't.</b>
